        "text": "Once in each of its controller’s Standby Phases this face-up monster activates a mandatory non-targeting effect. When it resolves, count all monsters the activating player currently controls, including face-down monsters and this card if still controlled. Gain 400 LP per counted monster. Do not count opposing monsters. It has no cost and does not require the original source to remain face-up once activated.",
